# Your own additions when you build from a checkout: package names here, one or
# several per line, then ./build.sh.
#
# An installed ryad has no checkout to edit, and an upgrade would replace this
# file anyway. Keep them in a list of your own, which is merged with these:
#   mkdir -p ~/.config/ryad/packages
#   echo postgresql-client >> ~/.config/ryad/packages/50-mine.list
#   ryad build
# A file there named like a built-in list replaces it, so pick another name
# unless that is what you want. See docs/customization.md, "Add apt packages".
